The "fresh reviewers" idea in skills/goldfish/SKILL.md — that the agent which wrote a plan
must not be the agent that approves it, and that distinct review "lenses" should be run by
subagents with no prior context — is derived from EGM's concept. This project re-implements
that concept in prose and does not copy EGM's source code. Any attribution and NOTICE
requirements of the EGM project are acknowledged here.

